The movement otherwise carries the Movement 6 close correctly. It opens with five people, three boxes and Oryn's unnamed mule (45:3–5), 102 marks (46:189), Cael nineteen with ten fragments and deployment thirteen (45:53; 46:195), one completed self-reading and two still owed (45:45–53), Lira's left arm slung and right ankle taped (45:15), Brom's sound hand and the bow, hook and five bolts (48:247–255), Karis's covered count and boxes (46:95–103), and Seln's shut case (46:275–283). Those states agree with the Movement 6 close (37:77–87; 39:57–61,245–249; 40:55–67,367–389; 43:125–153,175–199; 44:167–219).

