editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-55-- **Shadow is used once in this movement**, unseen and never attributable. That is its second and last use in the book.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-56-- **The rim saw a practitioner walk out declaring, and saw nothing work inside.** Teague saw the same and asks nothing.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-57-- Faceless: no seals, no names, no office. The specialist is not the Ostrand-road woman: the same craft, a different weight in the laying.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-58-- The case is untouched. The index and the stroke-and-bar are not decoded. Nobody theorizes.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-07-void-roads/packets/MOVEMENT-007.md-59-- Oryn joins as a stop on her route, never as "sixth," never "join." The Stair slip's three hundred is taken and never paid.

