+- Chapter 50 cuts repeated positions from “Cael learned the room by its sounds, and he went over it again and again” to “Cael learned the room by its sounds” (`chapter-50.md:5`), and folds Oryn's repeated pulse procedure into one sentence (`50:83`).
+- Chapter 51 removes repeated reactions and position inventories while leaving the complete nine-line night log and its sum intact (`chapter-51.md:193–217`).
